{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10360350","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10360350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1036035001:1":{"text":"우린 물건을 지키고 있어요. 다른 사람들은 빛나는 꽃 때문에 엉망이 된 마을을 정리하러 갔고요.","source_cn":"我们在看守大家的东西，大家去收拾被荧荧花破坏的村子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9600883E9AA21A55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1036035002:1":{"text":"사람들이 정리를 끝내고 돌아오면 같이 물건을 가지고 우리의 마을로 돌아갈 거예요.","source_cn":"等他们收拾好后，我们再和他们一起回到自己的村庄。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7828C1314D634A10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民奇美莉":{"text":"기멜리","source":"村民奇美莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}